ervation, and a narrow continuation branch that must not reopen dispatch-degraded or skipped-empty-findings rounds.","prompt_body":"Inspect where the plan inserts INSCOPE_REMAINING parsing and header-only findings-classification.tsv detection relative to existing post-tally terminal mapping that sets LOOP_REASON=zero-findings-degraded-panel when ACCEPTED_COUNT is zero and DEGRADED_PANEL is one. Confirm the planned ballot-items-lost branch in plan-review-continuation.sh requires all five predicates and cannot fire for voter-dispatch failures, skipped-empty-findings, or degraded-empty-collector rounds that also show zero accepted. Verify round-summary.env persistence includes INSCOPE_REMAINING for audit as documented. Cite specific file paths and line ranges for any issues found, and follow the output-format rules from your outer wrapper exactly."}]}
